  "wants_video": false,
  "ig_caption": "He woke up to 3 booked jobs.\nHe didn't answer a single call.\n\nMeet Dave. A plumber drowning in missed calls, unanswered texts, and lost leads.\n\nWe built him a system with N8N + GoHighLevel that:\n→ Replies to leads in under 60 seconds\n→ Qualifies them with the right questions\n→ Sends quotes automatically\n→ Books the job straight into his calendar\n\nAll while he's asleep. Or on a job. Or with his kids.\n\n3 confirmed bookings between 11pm and 6am. Zero human effort.\n\nStill answering every enquiry manually?\n\n#AIAutomation #N8N #GoHighLevel #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #ClaudeAI #GoogleWorkspace #WorkflowAutomation #AIAgents #Accelod #TradesBusiness #PlumberLife #SmallBusinessOwner #LeadGeneration #SalesAutomation #DigitalTransformation #NoCode #AITools #BusinessGrowth #AutomationTools #CRM #MarketingAutomation #SmartBusiness #ScaleYourBusiness #ChatbotMarketing",
  "fb_caption": "He woke up to 3 booked jobs. He didn't answer a single call.\n\nMeet Dave. A plumber who was drowning in missed calls and lost leads.\n\nWe built him a system with N8N + GoHighLevel that:\n→ Replies to leads in under 60 seconds\n→ Qualifies them automatically\n→ Sends the quote\n→ Books the job into his calendar\n\nAll while he's asleep. 3 bookings confirmed between 11pm and 6am. Zero human effort.\n\nIf you own a trades business, imagine what you'd do with an extra 3 jobs a day booked before breakfast.\n\nHow many leads do you think you're losing every week because no one replies fast enough?\n\n#AIAutomation #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #TradesBusiness #Accelod",
  "ig_url": "https://i.ibb.co/d48McpFF/bb9b9e630d3a.png",
  "fb_url": "https://i.ibb.co/hxxyf4t5/1e8c1a193af9.png",
  "ig_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>Accelod AI - Proposal App Case Study</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/dom-to-image-more@3.3.0/dist/dom-to-image-more.min.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n  body { background:#050d18; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; padding:20px; gap:20px; }\n  #post {\n    width:1080px; height:1350px;\n    background:#0B1929;\n    position:relative;\n    overflow:hidden;\n    padding:75px 70px;\n    display:flex; flex-direction:column;\n  }\n  .dotgrid {\n    position:absolute; inset:0;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,212,255,0.12) 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);\n    background-size: 26px 26px;\n    opacity:0.4;\n    pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  .glow {\n    position:absolute; top:-200px; left:-200px;\n    width:700px; height:700px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,212,255,0.18) 0%, transparent 60%);\n    pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position:absolute; top:40px; right:-60px;\n    width:420px; height:420px;\n    opacity:0.05;\n    transform:rotate(12deg);\n    pointer-events:none;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\n    border:1.5px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.5);\n    border-radius:100px;\n    padding:12px 22px;\n    color:#00D4FF;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n    font-size:18px; font-weight:500;\n    width:fit-content;\n    position:relative; z-index:2;\n    background:rgba(0,212,255,0.05);\n  }\n  .badge svg { width:20px; height:20px; }\n  h1 {\n    font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:88px;\n    line-height:0.95;\n    letter-spacing:-0.03em;\n    color:#fff;\n    margin-top:22px;\n    position:relative; z-index:2;\n  }\n  h1 em {\n    font-style:normal;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#00D4FF,#33E1FF);\n    -webkit-background-clip:text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;\n    background-clip:text;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;\n    font-size:22px;\n    color:#B8CCE0;\n    margin-top:18px;\n    line-height:1.45;\n    position:relative; z-index:2;\n    max-width:900px;\n  }\n  .panel {\n    background:#06101A;\n    border:1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.2);\n    border-radius:16px;\n    padding:30px 36px;\n    margin-top:24px;\n    position:relative; z-index:2;\n    flex:1;\n    display:flex; flex-direction:column;\n    gap:20px;\n  }\n  .stat-hero {\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;\n    padding:14px 20px 18px;\n    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.15);\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,212,255,0.14), rgba(0,212,255,0.04));\n    border:1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.35);\n    border-radius:14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0,212,255,0.15), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,212,255,0.05);\n    position:relative;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .stat-hero::before {\n    content:'';\n    position:absolute;\n    left:0; top:0; bottom:0;\n    width:5px;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#00D4FF,#33E1FF);\n  }\n  .stat-hero .num {\n    font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:112px;\n    line-height:1;\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00D4FF,#33E1FF);\n    -webkit-background-clip:text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;\n    letter-spacing:-0.04em;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,212,255,0.4);\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(0,212,255,0.3));\n  }\n  .stat-hero .label {\n    font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;\n    font-size:24px;\n    color:#fff;\n    text-align:right;\n    line-height:1.3;\n    max-width:380px;\n    font-weight:500;\n  }\n  .stat-hero .label span {\n    color:#00D4FF;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n    font-size:18px;\n    display:block;\n    margin-top:6px;\n    font-weight:500;\n    letter-spacing:0.05em;\n  }\n  .stack {\n    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:11px;\n  }\n  .stack-title {\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n    font-size:17px;\n    color:#B8CCE0;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    letter-spacing:0.1em;\n    margin-bottom:2px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px;\n    padding:13px 18px;\n    border-radius:12px;\n    background:rgba(0,212,255,0.04);\n    border-left:3px solid #00D4FF;\n  }\n  .row.alt { background:rgba(0,212,255,0.02); border-left-color:#33E1FF; }\n  .row img, .row svg { width:34px; height:34px; object-fit:contain; flex-shrink:0; }\n  .row .step {\n    font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:28px;\n    color:#00D4FF;\n    min-width:40px;\n  }\n  .row .text {\n    font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;\n    font-size:20px;\n    color:#fff;\n    line-height:1.35;\n    flex:1;\n  }\n  .row .text b { color:#00D4FF; font-weight:500; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:18px; }\n  .built-note {\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,212,255,0.12), rgba(0,212,255,0.03));\n    border:1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.3);\n    border-radius:12px;\n    padding:16px 20px;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;\n  }\n  .built-note svg { width:32px; height:32px; color:#00D4FF; flex-shrink:0; }\n  .built-note .txt {\n    font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;\n    font-size:19px;\n    color:#fff;\n    line-height:1.4;\n  }\n  .built-note .txt b {\n    color:#00D4FF;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n    font-size:17px;\n    font-weight:500;\n  }\n  .bookings {\n    display:flex; gap:12px;\n    margin-top:2px;\n  }\n  .booking {\n    flex:1;\n    background:rgba(34,197,94,0.08);\n    border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3);\n    border-radius:12px;\n    padding:14px 10px;\n    text-align:center;\n    display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:4px;\n  }\n  .booking .stage-icon {\n    width:36px; height:36px;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n    color:#22C55E;\n    margin-bottom:2px;\n  }\n  .booking .stage-icon svg { width:100%; height:100%; }\n  .booking .time {\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n    font-size:16px;\n    color:#22C55E;\n    font-weight:500;\n    letter-spacing:0.05em;\n  }\n  .booking .job {\n    font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;\n    font-size:19px;\n    color:#fff;\n    margin-top:4px;\n    font-weight:500;\n    line-height:1.25;\n  }\n  .booking .check {\n    font-size:20px;\n    margin-top:4px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;\n    margin-top:24px;\n    position:relative; z-index:2;\n  }\n  .cta {\n    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#00D4FF,#33E1FF);\n    color:#0B1929;\n    padding:20px 32px;\n    border-radius:100px;\n    font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;\n    font-weight:700;\n    font-size:26px;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-size:32px;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#00D4FF,#33E1FF);\n    -webkit-background-clip:text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;\n    letter-spacing:-0.02em;\n  }\n  .logo small {\n    display:block;\n    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;\n    font-size:12px;\n    color:#B8CCE0;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color:#B8CCE0;\n    font-weight:400;\n    letter-spacing:0.2em;\n    text-align:right;\n    margin-top:2px;\n  }\n  #exportBtn {\n    padding:14px 28px; background:#00D4FF; color:#0B1929;\n    border:none; border-radius:8px; font-weight:700; font-size:16px;\n    cursor:pointer; font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute\">\n  <symbol id=\"claude-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n    <g fill=\"currentColor\">\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"90\" rx=\"2\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"90\" rx=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(30 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"90\" rx=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(60 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"90\" rx=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(90 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"90\" rx=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(120 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"5\" width=\"4\" height=\"90\" rx=\"2\" transform=\"rotate(150 50 50)\"/>\n    </g>\n  </symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"icon-paper\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9z\"/>\n    <path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M14 3v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8M8 9h2\"/>\n  </symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"icon-send\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M22 2L11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7z\"/>\n  </symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"icon-pound\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M18 7c0-2.5-2-4.5-5-4.5S8 4.5 8 7v4H5m0 0h11M5 11v4c0 2-1 3.5-2 4.5h15M9 15h6\"/>\n  </symbol>\n</svg>\n\n<div id=\"post\">\n  <div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dotgrid\"></div>\n  <svg class=\"watermark\" style=\"color:#00D4FF\"><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n\n  <div class=\"badge\">\n    <svg style=\"color:#00D4FF\"><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n    Custom Proposal App\n  </div>\n\n  <h1>I built an app that<br>gets me <em>paid.</em></h1>\n\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">No more chasing quotes in spreadsheets. A custom Proposal App that writes, sends, tracks and collects payment — fully on autopilot.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"panel\">\n\n    <div class=\"stat-hero\">\n      <div class=\"num\">10x</div>\n      <div class=\"label\">faster from quote to cash<span>WRITTEN, SENT & PAID 💸</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bookings\">\n      <div class=\"booking\">\n        <div class=\"stage-icon\"><svg><use href=\"#icon-paper\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">WRITE</div>\n        <div class=\"job\">AI drafts the proposal</div>\n        <div class=\"check\">✅</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"booking\">\n        <div class=\"stage-icon\"><svg><use href=\"#icon-send\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">SEND</div>\n        <div class=\"job\">Delivered in one click</div>\n        <div class=\"check\">✅</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"booking\">\n        <div class=\"stage-icon\"><svg><use href=\"#icon-pound\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"time\">PAID</div>\n        <div class=\"job\">Stripe takes deposit</div>\n        <div class=\"check\">✅</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <div class=\"stack-title\">Inside the Proposal App</div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <span class=\"step\">01</span>\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/anthropic/00D4FF\" alt=\"Claude\">\n        <div class=\"text\"><b>CLAUDE</b> writes the full proposal from a short brief</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row alt\">\n        <span class=\"step\">02</span>\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/supabase/3ECF8E\" alt=\"Supabase\">\n        <div class=\"text\"><b>NETLIFY + SUPABASE</b> host the app, send it & track opens</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <span class=\"step\">03</span>\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.simpleicons.org/stripe/635BFF\" alt=\"Stripe\">\n        <div class=\"text\"><b>STRIPE</b> collects the deposit the moment they sign</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"built-note\">\n      <svg><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"txt\">Built end-to-end with <b>Claude Code</b> — one custom app replacing 4 disconnected tools with a single clean workflow.</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"cta\">Want one? 👀</div>\n    <div class=\"logo\">Accelod AI<small>AUTOMATION STUDIO</small></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<button id=\"exportBtn\">Export PNG</button>\n\n<script>\n  document.getElementById('exportBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const node = document.getElementById('post');\n    domtoimage.toPng(node, { width:1080, height:1350, quality:1, bgcolor:'#0B1929' })\n      .then(dataUrl => {\n        const link = document.createElement('a');\n        link.download = 'accelod-proposal-app.png';\n        link.href = dataUrl;\n        link.click();\n      });\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "fb_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>Accelod AI - Proposal App Case Study</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/dom-to-image-more@3.3.0/dist/dom-to-image-more.min.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 40px;\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  }\n  #post {\n    width: 1200px;\n    height: 630px;\n    background: #0B1929;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  }\n  .dot-grid {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,212,255,0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 24px 24px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .top-glow {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -200px;\n    left: -200px;\n    width: 600px;\n    height: 600px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,212,255,0.22) 0%, transparent 60%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .bottom-glow {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: -150px;\n    right: -150px;\n    width: 500px;\n    height: 500px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,212,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -80px;\n    right: -80px;\n    width: 500px;\n    height: 500px;\n    opacity: 0.05;\n    transform: rotate(12deg);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    width: 445px;\n    padding: 40px 24px 36px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    border: 1.5px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.7);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #00D4FF;\n    width: fit-content;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.08);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,212,255,0.15);\n  }\n  .badge svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n  .headline {\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 56px;\n    line-height: 0.98;\n    letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n    color: white;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n  }\n  .headline em {\n    font-style: normal;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D4FF, #33E1FF);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    background-clip: text;\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(0,212,255,0.4));\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n  .subtitle strong {\n    color: #33E1FF;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .cta-pill {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 13px 22px;\n    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.18);\n    border: 1.5px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.7);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    color: #00D4FF;\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    width: fit-content;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,212,255,0.2);\n  }\n  .logo {\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D4FF, #33E1FF);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    background-clip: text;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .right-panel {\n    flex: 1;\n    margin: 32px 32px 32px 0;\n    background: #06101A;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.2);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 24px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .panel-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.15);\n  }\n  .panel-title {\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  }\n  .status-live {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #22C55E;\n  }\n  .status-dot {\n    width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #22C55E; border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #22C55E;\n  }\n  .flow-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.05);\n    border-left: 3px solid #00D4FF;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n  }\n  .flow-row.step2 {\n    background: rgba(245,158,11,0.05);\n    border-left-color: #F59E0B;\n  }\n  .flow-row.step3 {\n    background: rgba(34,197,94,0.05);\n    border-left-color: #22C55E;\n  }\n  .step-num {\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #33E1FF;\n    min-width: 32px;\n  }\n  .flow-row.step2 .step-num { color: #F59E0B; }\n  .flow-row.step3 .step-num { color: #22C55E; }\n  .stage-icon {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.12);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.35);\n    color: #33E1FF;\n  }\n  .flow-row.step2 .stage-icon {\n    background: rgba(245,158,11,0.12);\n    border-color: rgba(245,158,11,0.4);\n    color: #F59E0B;\n  }\n  .flow-row.step3 .stage-icon {\n    background: rgba(34,197,94,0.12);\n    border-color: rgba(34,197,94,0.4);\n    color: #22C55E;\n  }\n  .stage-icon svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }\n  .stage-icon .glyph {\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .flow-info {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 3px;\n  }\n  .flow-title {\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: white;\n  }\n  .flow-sub {\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n  }\n  .check-icon {\n    width: 26px; height: 26px;\n    background: #22C55E;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .stack-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,212,255,0.08), rgba(0,212,255,0.02));\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.15);\n  }\n  .stack-label {\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .stack-label svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; color: #00D4FF; }\n  .stack-tools {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .stat-strip {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .stat-block {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n  }\n  .stat-num {\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D4FF, #33E1FF);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    background-clip: text;\n  }\n  .stat-label {\n    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  }\n  #export {\n    margin-top: 24px;\n    padding: 12px 28px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D4FF, #33E1FF);\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    color: #0B1929;\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute\">\n  <symbol id=\"claude-star\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n    <g fill=\"currentColor\">\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"0\" width=\"4\" height=\"100\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"0\" width=\"4\" height=\"100\" transform=\"rotate(30 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"0\" width=\"4\" height=\"100\" transform=\"rotate(60 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"0\" width=\"4\" height=\"100\" transform=\"rotate(90 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"0\" width=\"4\" height=\"100\" transform=\"rotate(120 50 50)\"/>\n      <rect x=\"48\" y=\"0\" width=\"4\" height=\"100\" transform=\"rotate(150 50 50)\"/>\n    </g>\n  </symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"icon-doc\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n      <path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/>\n      <polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/>\n      <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"13\"/>\n      <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"17\"/>\n    </g>\n  </symbol>\n  <symbol id=\"icon-invoice\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n      <path d=\"M6 2h9l5 5v13a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/>\n      <polyline points=\"15 2 15 7 20 7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/>\n      <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"16\"/>\n    </g>\n  </symbol>\n</svg>\n\n<div id=\"post\">\n  <div class=\"top-glow\"></div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-glow\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-grid\"></div>\n  <svg class=\"watermark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" style=\"color:#00D4FF\"><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n\n  <div class=\"left-col\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" style=\"color:#00D4FF\"><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n      BUILT WITH CLAUDE CODE\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"headline\">I built an app that <em>gets me paid.</em></h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Proposals out. Invoices sent. Stripe payments collected — <strong>all from one Proposal App I built myself using Claude Code.</strong> No SaaS subscriptions. No duct-taped tools.</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:auto; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;\">\n      <div class=\"cta-pill\">→ Want a Proposal App for your business?</div>\n      <div class=\"logo\">accelod.ai</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"right-panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-header\">\n      <div class=\"panel-title\">⚡ MY PROPOSAL APP</div>\n      <div class=\"status-live\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>LIVE IN PRODUCTION</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flow-row\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">01</div>\n      <div class=\"stage-icon\">\n        <svg><use href=\"#icon-doc\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flow-info\">\n        <div class=\"flow-title\">Proposal generated & sent</div>\n        <div class=\"flow-sub\">CLIENT INTAKE → BRANDED PDF → EMAIL</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"check-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flow-row step2\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"stage-icon\">\n        <svg><use href=\"#icon-invoice\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flow-info\">\n        <div class=\"flow-title\">Invoice created automatically</div>\n        <div class=\"flow-sub\">ON ACCEPTANCE → LINE ITEMS → DELIVERED</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"check-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flow-row step3\">\n      <div class=\"step-num\">03</div>\n      <div class=\"stage-icon\">\n        <span class=\"glyph\">£</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flow-info\">\n        <div class=\"flow-title\">Payment collected via Stripe</div>\n        <div class=\"flow-sub\">ONE-CLICK CHECKOUT · CARD · ACH</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"check-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack-row\">\n      <div class=\"stack-label\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\"><use href=\"#claude-star\"/></svg>\n        BUILT WITH\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack-tools\">\n        <span style=\"color:#00D4FF;font-weight:700;\">Netlify</span>\n        <span style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);font-weight:700;\">+</span>\n        <span>Supabase</span>\n        <span style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);font-weight:700;\">+</span>\n        <span>Stripe</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stat-strip\">\n      <div class=\"stat-block\">\n        <div class=\"stat-num\">$0</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">SAAS FEES</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-block\">\n        <div class=\"stat-num\">10x</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">SPEED</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-block\">\n        <div class=\"stat-num\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">APP, FULLY MINE</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<button id=\"export\">Export PNG</button>\n\n<script>\n  document.getElementById('export').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    const node = document.getElementById('post');\n    domtoimage.toPng(node, { width: 1200, height: 630, quality: 1, bgcolor: '#0B1929' })\n      .then(dataUrl => {\n        const link = document.createElement('a');\n        link.download = 'accelod-proposal-app-post.png';\n        link.href = dataUrl;\n        link.click();\n      });\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
}